"version 3 or later E<lt>https://gnu.org/licenses/gpl.htmlE<gt>."
msgstr ""
"Drepturi de autor \\(co 2023 Free Software Foundation, Inc. Licența GPLv3+: "
"GNU GPL versiunea 3 sau ulterioară E<lt>https://gnu.org/licenses/"
"gpl.htmlE<gt>."

